Today I got my Valkyrie killed by brainlessness. 
(Of her and myself)

This Valkyrie was really strong and good equipped. I really thought, she
could not die anymore. (She even wore an Amulet of Life-Saving for
emergencies)

The lesser fault was first killing the Wizard, but forgetting Vlad. So
the Wizard haunted me from time to time.

The greater fault, which got me killed was not using the scrolls of
genocide against the Mindflayers (before my death there were 3 of them)
This Mindflayers seem to be summoned from the Wizard. 

I thought, my Life-Saving-Amulet would not only restore my Hitpoints,
but also my attributes, so i got killed my brain-eating VOLUNTARILY!

At the first Message i was happy: There stood, i would come back to
life. But the second Message was the pasted screen. 

Lessons learnd from this dead for Me:
 - Lookup effects of Items before relying on them
 - Be paranoid. (Genocide first, not at the "best Moment")
 - Dont haste through Lategame. (I would have had less Encounters)

